      en: ["Vlahinja Ridge is situated on the Sinjajevina highlands at about 1,700 to 1,900 meters.", "The region has the largest mountain pasture area in Montenegro.", "The name 'Vlahinja' refers to the historical presence of Vlach shepherds.", "Geologically, sinkholes and other exokarstic forms dominate the landscape.", "The area is a key part of the planned Sinjajevina Regional Nature Park.", "In winter, the ridge is often buried under a thick snow cover for months."],
